{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/", "pk": 716, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/", "pk": 546, "shortname": "dolphindiscoveries", "name": "Dolphin Discoveries", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Deluxe Kona Snorkel Adventure (2 snorkel spots)", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Deluxe Kona Snorkel Adventure (2 snorkel spots)", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": false, "is_no_tax": false, "sortable_index": 100, "description": "#*Snorkel the most popular and beautiful spots in all of Hawai’i*\n\n\n##Duration\n• 4 hours + 1 hour for the check in process. \n\n\n##About\nThis adventure takes 4 hours on the water. Snorkel the beautiful marine sanctuary at Captain Cook's Monument in Kealakekua Bay and the Place of Refuge (Two Step).  We provide guests with snorkeling, cultural, and environmental information relevant to the Island of Hawai’i and its rich history.   Additionally, your captain will show you several spectacular, unique volcanic geological phenomena including sea caves and lava tubes.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "Snorkel Kona Hawaii\nKona Snorkel tours", "location": "Kailua-Kona, HI", "booking_notes": "**IMPORTANT INFORMATION BELOW:**\n\nPlease take a moment to watch our video regarding what to expect for your upcoming Deluxe Kona Snorkel Adventure by clicking the link to our YouTube Video below:\n\n[Know Before You Go](https://youtu.be/3NuUk1Js_OA)\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n\n1. Sign our e-waiver upon receipt of this email by clicking the \"Sign Waiver\" link above.  Complete **ONE** on-line waiver for **EACH** person in your party.  Minors can be included with one parent or guardians waiver.  This email can be forwarded to everyone in your group so that they have access to the waiver link.\n\n2. Check in is at our retail location in the Keauhou Shopping Center, 78-6831 Alii Drive. (park near Tropics Tap House and walk into the center).  Detailed check in times noted below. (click the \"meet us at\" link above).\n  \n3. You will drive to Keauhou Bay, 78-100 Kaleiopapa St, Kailua-Kona, HI 96740, where the crew will meet you for your tour. (click the \"we will end at\" link above).\n\nTransportation to our retail location and to Keauhou Bay is the responsibility of the guests.  If you are taking an Uber, please add a first stop and second stop to your reservation so that the driver will wait for you at the retail location to take you to Keauhou Bay \n\nYou do not need to return to our retail location after the tour unless you would like a souvenir!\n\n**CHECK IN AND TOUR TIMES **\n\n•\tTour Check in time – 8am (Store does not open until 8am)\n•\tTour Departs Keauhou Bay – 9am\n•\tTour returns to Keauhou Bay – 1pm\n\n**INCLUDED WITH YOUR TOUR:**\n• All snorkel gear (prescription masks available for rent)\n• Pool Noodles\n• Bottled water, aloha juices, fresh fruit and light snacks \n\n**WHAT TO BRING:**\nPlease wear your swimsuit, shoes that are easy to kick off, light cover-up, towel and hat, if desired.  Tips for your crew always appreciated.\n\n**SUNSCREEN LAW:**\n\n**BRING REEF SAFE SUNSCREEN LOTION ONLY (spray on sunscreen will not be allowed)** -  WHEN SHOPPING, PLEASE CHOOSE A ZINC OR MINERAL BASED SUNSCREEN. For your convenience, we sell 3oz. tubes of sunscreen that meets Hawai'i's reef safe requirements.  (Please check that it does **NOT** contain these ingredients:  **oxybenzone, octinoxate, avobenzone or octocrylene**).  \n\n**PARKING AT KEAUHOU BAY:**  As you turn onto Kaleiopapa Street, there is free \"ON THE STREET\" parking on the left and right.  Find an open spot to park and walk down until you see the boat ramp area on the left.  Be mindful of the no parking areas. DO NOT park in the boat trailer parking, boat wash down area or block any driveways.  Once parked, please wait near the restrooms across from the boat ramps. Once all guests are checked in at the retail location, your crew will meet you to start the trip.\n\n##NEED TO KNOW:##\nGuests must be comfortable with swimming. \nMinimum age: 6yrs old\nMinors must be accompanied by an adult at all times whether in the water or on the boat\n\n**Additional Info:**\nThere is a storage box on the boat for a small bag with personal items.\n\nPlease take a moment to review our FAQ's page on our website where you can find answers to many questions.  \n\nhttps://www.dolphindiscoveries.com/faq/\n\nInformational Videos:\n[What To Bring](https://youtu.be/t2M4rp7Fj_0)\n[Equipment Fitting](https://youtu.be/3m9u_dimWyo)\n\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/eg1RP2BbTxiehUYWAcoi)\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3Sr9cifQoeOB29XRUR56)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "Click here for google maps link:  https://goo.gl/maps/sUBXg6wFHj5y2neo9\n\nYou may also visit our website for directions from Kona Airport and/or the resorts along Alii Dr. in Kona.\n\nAll tours depart from the boat ramp at Keauhou Bay, next to the Sheraton resort.\n\nThere is on the street parking for free. \n\nCheck in is at the picnic table on the lawn area by the restrooms, across from the boat ramp.", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Ages 6+ • 4 Hours on the water • Snorkel two of Kona’s best spots on one trip!", "short_description": "", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Uhcd75MrQQmJk989g26k", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Uhcd75MrQQmJk989g26k", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/images/1668568/", "pk": 1668568, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CiflNwJeTnCScjnQ4bTY", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CiflNwJeTnCScjnQ4bTY", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CiflNwJeTnCScjnQ4bTY", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CiflNwJeTnCScjnQ4bTY", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/images/4958/", "pk": 4958, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/Ez0QbwXvRYmCILggaGjv", "image_cdn_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/Ez0QbwXvRYmCILggaGjv", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/"}, "crop": {"y": 21, "x": 0, "width": 350, "url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/bOANieYWS1qESJ3ZbLNa", "height": 184}, "cropped_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/bOANieYWS1qESJ3ZbLNa", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://www.filepicker.io/api/file/bOANieYWS1qESJ3ZbLNa", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/dolphindiscoveries/items/716/images/4953/", "pk": 4953, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://www.filepicker.io